  "correct": "2.75",
  "solution": "Chọn hệ trục tọa độ và các điểm như trên hình vẽ:\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/24518ca6ba13e1ac5a73a08080e43d1b5051e8cfa308408beaaf131c70d55c2b.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tKhi đó phương trình mái vòm là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>h</mi></semantics></math> là chiều cao của mái vòm tại điểm cách tâm của đường hầm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> m.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>21</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>75</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.",
